 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2025 年 5 月，一个犯罪团伙，找上了 Coinbase 的外包客服。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 5 月，一个犯罪团伙，找上了 Coinbase 的外包客服。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 5.376,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 6.126
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "他们没去撬钱包，只是花钱，收买了客服。",
   "spoken": "他们没去撬钱包，只是花钱，收买了客服。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-01.mp3",
   "start": 7.196,
   "dur": 4.248,
   "speechStart": 7.294,
   "speechEnd": 10.603
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "被收买的人，从客服工具里，导出了 69461 名用户的数据。",
   "spoken": "被收买的人，从客服工具里，导出了 69461 名用户的数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-02.mp3",
   "start": 11.664,
   "dur": 6.048,
   "speechStart": 11.762,
   "speechEnd": 16.881
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "姓名、联系方式、证件图像、余额、交易记录。",
   "spoken": "姓名、联系方式、证件图像、余额、交易记录。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-03.mp3",
   "start": 17.932,
   "dur": 5.424,
   "speechStart": 18.03,
   "speechEnd": 22.506
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "可这份数据里，没有密码，也没有私钥。",
   "spoken": "可这份数据里，没有密码，也没有私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-04.mp3",
   "start": 23.576,
   "dur": 4.104,
   "speechStart": 23.674,
   "speechEnd": 26.84
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "没有钥匙，照理说，打不开任何一个账户。",
   "spoken": "没有钥匙，照理说，打不开任何一个账户。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-05.mp3",
   "start": 27.9,
   "dur": 4.344,
   "speechStart": 27.998,
   "speechEnd": 31.39
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "可 Coinbase 在提交给 SEC 的文件里估算，这次事件，要花掉约 1.8 亿到 4 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "可 Coinbase 在提交给 SEC 的文件里估算，这次事件，要花掉约 1.8 亿到 4 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-06.mp3",
   "start": 32.464,
   "dur": 7.2,
   "speechStart": 32.562,
   "speechEnd": 38.812
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "其中一项，是赔偿被冒充客服骗走资金的用户。",
   "spoken": "其中一项，是赔偿被冒充客服骗走资金的用户。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-07.mp3",
   "start": 39.884,
   "dur": 4.824,
   "speechStart": 39.982,
   "speechEnd": 43.874
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-08.mp3",
   "start": 44.928,
   "dur": 2.088,
   "speechStart": 45.026,
   "speechEnd": 46.18
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "一天，你接到电话，对方自称交易所客服。",
   "spoken": "一天，你接到电话，对方自称交易所客服。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-09.mp3",
   "start": 47.236,
   "dur": 4.512,
   "speechStart": 47.334,
   "speechEnd": 50.929
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "他叫得出你的名字，说得出你的余额，还知道你上周提过的工单。",
   "spoken": "他叫得出你的名字，说得出你的余额，还知道你上周提过的工单。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-10.mp3",
   "start": 51.968,
   "dur": 5.88,
   "speechStart": 52.066,
   "speechEnd": 57.006
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "他说你的账户有风险，请你把资产，转到一个安全钱包。",
   "spoken": "他说你的账户有风险，请你把资产，转到一个安全钱包。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-11.mp3",
   "start": 58.068,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 58.166,
   "speechEnd": 62.737
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-12",
   "text": "他是真客服吗？",
   "spoken": "他是真客服吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-12.mp3",
   "start": 63.808,
   "dur": 2.04,
   "speechStart": 63.906,
   "speechEnd": 65.013
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-13",
   "text": "带着这个问题，我们看看，泄露的数据怎样变成攻击。",
   "spoken": "带着这个问题，我们看看，泄漏的数据怎样变成攻击。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg1-13.mp3",
